  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening health systems and improving access to quality, effective and affordable health services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Strengthening health systems and improving access to quality, effective and affordable health services  is a component of Essential Services for Maternal and Child  Health [Services Essentiels de Sant&#xe9; Maternelle et Infantile en RDC (SEMI)] reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;24,624,612. It works in the following sector(s): Reproductive health care, Family planning, Basic health care, Health policy and administrative management, Basic nutrition, Malaria control, Infectious disease control.</narrative>
  </description>
